WEBVTT

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.899
- Fry! That's disgusting!
- What?

00:00:32.983 --> 00:00:34.735
You double-dipped! Geez.

00:00:38.488 --> 00:00:40.699
Crew, you're working too hard.

00:00:41.116 --> 00:00:42.409
Tell me about it.

00:00:42.492 --> 00:00:46.621
For once, I thought it might be nice
to do something in a social setting,

00:00:46.705 --> 00:00:48.707
finally get to know each other.

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.043
Why, I don't even know half your names!

00:00:51.126 --> 00:00:53.170
You, boy. What do they call you?

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:56.214
Most folks just call me Orange Joe.

00:00:56.298 --> 00:00:58.175
So, Professor, where are we gonna go?

00:00:58.258 --> 00:00:59.634
It's July, right?

00:00:59.718 --> 00:01:02.763
Let's wait three months
and go to Oktoberfest!

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:05.015
All right, baby!

00:01:16.902 --> 00:01:20.155
Bring on the beer!
And the scantily clad barmaids!

00:01:20.238 --> 00:01:21.865
And the more beer!

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:24.368
Shh!

00:01:25.327 --> 00:01:29.373
Hey! I don't smell Bavarian-style vomit.
Where's Oktoberfest?

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:31.416
This is Oktoberfest,

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.877
the world's most sophisticated exhibition

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:36.338
of German food, drink, and culture.

00:01:40.675 --> 00:01:41.927
Exquisite.

00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:43.303
Care for another, sir?

00:01:43.387 --> 00:01:48.600
No, I wouldn't want to ruin my Oktoberfest
by becoming intoxicated.

00:01:48.683 --> 00:01:50.560
What the hell is going on here?

00:01:50.644 --> 00:01:53.939
Fry, quiet.
Oktoberfest is a classy celebration

00:01:54.022 --> 00:01:55.732
of how far humans have evolved.

00:01:55.816 --> 00:01:57.776
You need to be on your best behavior.

00:01:57.859 --> 00:02:01.363
No chance! You can all act
like Jersey Shore socialites,

00:02:01.446 --> 00:02:04.157
but at least Bender will party with me.
Right, buddy?

00:02:04.241 --> 00:02:08.412
Whoa, whoa, whoa! I enjoy partying
as much as the next fellow,

00:02:08.495 --> 00:02:11.957
but this is Oktoberfest. Good day, sir!

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:14.334
Ach du freakin' Lieber!

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:18.171
A sausage contest, eh?

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:20.507
Sounds like fun on a bun!

00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:22.759
Shut up! I said it first!

00:02:22.926 --> 00:02:23.969
Bam!

00:02:24.136 --> 00:02:25.512
Also, ow.

00:02:25.595 --> 00:02:28.098
Oh, my God, it's celebrity chef Elzar!

00:02:28.306 --> 00:02:32.227
Hey, Elzar, I've just recently started
always having dreamt of being

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:34.813
a sausage-making champion.
Can I get in on this?

00:02:34.896 --> 00:02:37.649
Sure, I don't care.
You bring your ingredients?

00:02:37.733 --> 00:02:39.401
You bet!

00:02:40.986 --> 00:02:44.531
Hold on there, chief. Regular old pork
ain't gonna win this thing.

00:02:44.614 --> 00:02:46.366
You gotta get innovative with your meat.

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:47.868
See Chef Fritz over there?

00:02:47.951 --> 00:02:50.871
He's only using the choicest cuts
of hummingbird.

00:02:50.954 --> 00:02:54.791
Murakami-san got his hands
on a nice rack of angel wings.

00:02:54.875 --> 00:02:56.835
Gonna grind 'em up into Heavenwurst.

00:02:57.169 --> 00:03:01.048
And me? I'm making my
spice-weaseled bratwurst out of pork.

00:03:01.131 --> 00:03:02.716
So you are using pork!

00:03:02.799 --> 00:03:05.719
Pork that's been aged for 3,000 years!

00:03:06.011 --> 00:03:07.054
Bam!

00:03:07.429 --> 00:03:11.558
Aw, man! I can't beat that
with a Craigslist pig.

00:03:11.641 --> 00:03:15.604
Sorry, Grundy. I'll have to kill you later
for some other reason.

00:03:25.072 --> 00:03:28.200
Sit up straight!
The Countess von Luftballoon is watching.

00:03:28.533 --> 00:03:29.576
Ugh!

00:03:29.826 --> 00:03:34.456
Man, all the fun has been taken out of
this once-noble barf-a-palooza.

00:03:34.539 --> 00:03:36.458
You just say that
because you're primitive.

00:03:36.541 --> 00:03:38.418
People in your day
were backwards and crude.

00:03:38.502 --> 00:03:42.422
Well, at least we were hammered!
I'm as thirsty as a drunk.

00:03:42.506 --> 00:03:45.133
Where do all these child-sized beers
come from?

00:03:45.217 --> 00:03:47.677
See that magnificent heavily guarded cask?

00:03:47.844 --> 00:03:49.346
All the beer's in there.

00:03:49.554 --> 00:03:51.056
Ah!

00:03:57.562 --> 00:03:59.773
Not all the beer.

00:04:03.985 --> 00:04:07.364
Fahrvergnügen! Kaiser Permanente!

00:04:07.614 --> 00:04:08.907
Fruzen Gladje!

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:10.826
Fry! You're embarrassing us!

00:04:10.909 --> 00:04:13.578
I don't care! I'm finally having fun!

00:04:13.787 --> 00:04:16.289
Hey, come on, you keister-meisters!

00:04:16.373 --> 00:04:20.335
Eins, zwei, drei, vier,
lift your Stein and drink your beer!

00:04:20.419 --> 00:04:23.755
Ich bin ein never!

00:04:26.383 --> 00:04:31.555
Whoa! Even with harps, that's still
the famous Oktoberfest Chicken Dance!

00:04:36.727 --> 00:04:38.186
Oh, I almost forgot!

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:42.149
Get das booty up here, Leela!

00:04:42.232 --> 00:04:44.401
I brought his and her chicken hats!

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:49.072
Okay, that's it.
You are a boorish, primitive Neanderthal!

00:04:49.364 --> 00:04:51.533
Neanderthal?

00:04:51.783 --> 00:04:53.243
Yes. And I've had enough!

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:54.870
I'm breaking up with you!

00:04:56.246 --> 00:04:59.499
We were going out?

00:04:59.583 --> 00:05:02.419
I mean, no!

00:05:02.502 --> 00:05:04.921
And keep your stupid chicken hat, too!

00:05:10.719 --> 00:05:15.307
And the worst part is,
I had to have the breakup sex by myself!

00:05:16.683 --> 00:05:19.019
Fry, some of us have real problems.

00:05:19.102 --> 00:05:22.773
I just learned there are people with
fancier sausage meats than me!

00:05:25.842 --> 00:05:29.763
I hate future Oktoberfest!
It's supposed to be beer and bratwurst,

00:05:29.846 --> 00:05:32.766
not breakups and boring thing!

00:05:34.309 --> 00:05:38.021
For hundreds of years,
Oktoberfest has been held here,

00:05:38.105 --> 00:05:40.107
in the fertile Neander Valley,

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:44.903
where prehistoric man once hunted
the majestic Schnufel-Ufagus

00:05:44.987 --> 00:05:46.488
or woolly mammoth.

00:05:46.863 --> 00:05:51.326
To this day, paleontologists
sometimes find entire mammoths

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:54.121
frozen in the valley's icy glaciers,

00:05:54.204 --> 00:05:58.458
perfectly preserved
for exactly 30,000 years or so.

00:05:58.542 --> 00:06:02.462
Wait a minute,
mammoth meat aged for 30,000 years?

00:06:02.546 --> 00:06:05.132
Prize-winning sausage meat, here I come!

00:06:12.556 --> 00:06:15.142
I didn't know this ship had
a mammoth detector.

00:06:15.225 --> 00:06:17.978
You're drunk, Fry.
This is the elephant detector.

00:06:18.061 --> 00:06:19.855
I just set it to "big and woolly."

00:06:21.857 --> 00:06:23.025
Mammoth ahoy!

00:06:27.279 --> 00:06:29.906
Uh, Bender? I smell burning tusk.

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:32.200
That's probably it. Kill the engine.

00:06:59.102 --> 00:07:02.522
Wait till those judges
get their hands on my mammoth sausage!

00:07:05.442 --> 00:07:09.196
- My hair is caught! Bender!
- Turn it off!

00:07:09.279 --> 00:07:13.116
Sausage is great, sausage is great.
Sausage, sausage, sausage!

00:07:17.663 --> 00:07:19.706
This sausage is great!

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:22.751
You, mein Robot,
move on to the next round.

00:07:22.834 --> 00:07:24.336
Shut up, Judge, I know it.

00:07:24.962 --> 00:07:27.464
Way to go, Bender! Can I try a piece?

00:07:27.547 --> 00:07:29.591
You can have yourself a whole big boy.

00:07:32.052 --> 00:07:33.470
Mmm. Mmm!

00:07:33.553 --> 00:07:35.514
That's good. Where's Fry?

00:07:35.722 --> 00:07:39.309
I don't know. Last I saw, he was
jumping up and down in my meat grinder.

00:07:39.393 --> 00:07:41.061
By the way, you got a little something
right there.

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:45.148
This is the best sausage I've ever tasted!

00:07:46.358 --> 00:07:49.152
Oh, my God! That looks like Fry's hair!

00:07:49.236 --> 00:07:53.031
Oh, come on, don't make jokes like that
while I'm eating.

00:08:06.169 --> 00:08:07.379
Poor Philip.

00:08:07.462 --> 00:08:09.589
He looks so peaceful.

00:08:09.673 --> 00:08:11.842
It's tragedy on a bun.

00:08:13.927 --> 00:08:15.721
I ate Fry!

00:08:15.804 --> 00:08:19.141
I broke up with my boyfriend
and then I ate him!

00:08:19.308 --> 00:08:22.185
Oh, now, now. We've all been there.

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:27.482
The pain and guilt are too much!
I can't go on knowing what I've done!

00:08:31.445 --> 00:08:32.904
Fry!

00:08:38.619 --> 00:08:41.413
Can you really remove
all my memories of Fry?

00:08:41.496 --> 00:08:42.789
Oh, they'll still be there, hon.

00:08:42.873 --> 00:08:46.001
I'm just gonna snip the links between them
and your conscious brain.

00:08:46.084 --> 00:08:49.171
Like this one "Fry falls off zoo train."

00:08:49.296 --> 00:08:52.674
He thought he recognized
one of the monkeys!

00:08:54.676 --> 00:08:56.053
What was I crying about?

00:08:56.136 --> 00:08:59.306
Oh, we were just cuttin' onions, honey.
Let's keep going.

00:08:59.389 --> 00:09:03.936
"Fry sits on a pie."
"Fry finds popcorn in his belly button."

00:09:05.103 --> 00:09:07.356
"You eat a sausage made of Fry."

00:09:07.439 --> 00:09:10.400
"Fry gives you a chicken hat."
Oh, that's sweet.

00:09:14.905 --> 00:09:16.573
Good morning!

00:09:18.033 --> 00:09:19.743
Geez, who died?

00:09:22.829 --> 00:09:25.499
I don't know how Bender and I
do all this work by ourselves.

00:09:25.582 --> 00:09:27.459
Maybe we should hire a delivery boy.

00:09:27.542 --> 00:09:28.877
You mean like...

00:09:28.961 --> 00:09:32.381
Bender! Shh! We have to be careful
not to remind her!

00:09:32.464 --> 00:09:37.719
What about my feelings?
Fry was my best friend, and now he's dead!

00:09:41.139 --> 00:09:44.059
Nah, I'm just kidding.
My pastor helped me through my grief.

00:09:45.477 --> 00:09:47.854
Bender's a jerk, but he's right.

00:09:47.938 --> 00:09:51.483
We've all got to accept
that Fry is gone forever.

00:09:53.694 --> 00:09:57.823
Whoa. Where happened? What am I?

00:09:58.615 --> 00:10:02.703
Sausage is great, sausage is great.
Sausage, sausage, sausage.

00:10:06.873 --> 00:10:08.834
Whew! That was close.

00:10:15.465 --> 00:10:16.508
Whew!

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:19.177
Ahhh!

00:10:27.644 --> 00:10:29.771
Help! Boy trapped in ice!

00:10:36.778 --> 00:10:38.655
Oh! Thank you, thank you.

00:10:48.832 --> 00:10:50.876
Uh. How you get frozen?

00:10:50.959 --> 00:10:54.379
I don't know.
I think I whanged my head pretty bad.

00:10:56.214 --> 00:10:58.425
Uh, look normal to me.

00:10:58.508 --> 00:11:01.094
The last thing I remember
is losing all my memories.

00:11:01.178 --> 00:11:02.638
Who am I, one of you?

00:11:02.721 --> 00:11:07.392
Me think so. Anyone dumb enough get
stuck in ice probably Neanderthal.

00:11:07.726 --> 00:11:09.311
Neanderthal?

00:11:09.394 --> 00:11:11.563
Yeah, I think somebody called me that.

00:11:11.897 --> 00:11:14.191
I'm kind of chilly.
I don't suppose you have a...

00:11:18.904 --> 00:11:20.530
Oh! Still warm!

00:11:23.992 --> 00:11:25.953
So, what's this delivery to McPluto?

00:11:26.036 --> 00:11:31.541
Fifty three tons of hamburgers
and French Fragments of not potatoes.

00:11:31.625 --> 00:11:33.919
Fragments of not potatoes?

00:11:34.086 --> 00:11:38.090
Yep. They get a big shipment
every Fri... Saturday!

00:11:39.466 --> 00:11:41.009
What's this?

00:11:41.093 --> 00:11:45.138
Oh, it's some kind of
chicken hat! It's cute.

00:11:45.514 --> 00:11:49.476
So why does it make me feel,
I don't know, sad?

00:12:07.995 --> 00:12:10.247
Why you stare at prehistoric pig butt?

00:12:10.622 --> 00:12:15.460
Because it makes me feel happy
and confused and wistful and sad.

00:12:15.627 --> 00:12:19.798
- All Neanderthal sad. It in our nature.
- Why?

00:12:20.007 --> 00:12:24.761
It all start 30,000 year ago,
in fertile Neander Valley.

00:12:26.763 --> 00:12:31.602
Life for our ancestors peaceful,
until Homo sapiens arrive.

00:12:31.977 --> 00:12:35.897
We suggest interbreed,
become one big happy species.

00:12:35.981 --> 00:12:38.817
But they treat us like
second-class hominid.

00:12:40.444 --> 00:12:42.070
They drive us from valley,

00:12:42.154 --> 00:12:45.532
and we end up living here,
in isolated crevice.

00:12:45.616 --> 00:12:47.451
We figure, "whatever."

00:12:47.534 --> 00:12:50.662
But then, we get trapped
by encroaching ice age.

00:12:50.912 --> 00:12:55.000
Now we sealed in under sky of ice.

00:12:55.375 --> 00:12:58.670
So my sadness makes perfect sense.

00:12:58.754 --> 00:13:02.174
And I do have vague memories
of people refusing to breed with me!

00:13:08.847 --> 00:13:11.016
A raven's brought word for you, sir.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:15.228
Guys, guys! My sausage made
the finals at Oktoberfest!

00:13:15.312 --> 00:13:17.397
We gotta go back for the closing ceremony!

00:13:17.522 --> 00:13:19.024
Oktoberfest?

00:13:29.534 --> 00:13:30.911
Sounds like fun!

00:13:33.246 --> 00:13:38.293
Chief! Me find huge hole melted in ice,
out past Cesar Chavez ridge!

00:13:38.377 --> 00:13:40.712
Hole go all the way outside!

00:13:40.796 --> 00:13:42.673
This very interesting.

00:13:42.756 --> 00:13:45.550
Maybe someone look into it,
many years from now.

00:13:45.634 --> 00:13:47.761
But, Chief, this means
we're not trapped anymore!

00:13:47.844 --> 00:13:49.972
It's our chance to take back
the outside world

00:13:50.055 --> 00:13:54.643
from those stuck-up Homo sapiens
with their tools and their pants and such.

00:13:55.269 --> 00:13:57.813
My fellow big-brows! Are you with me?

00:14:06.613 --> 00:14:10.701
You've been staring at that pumpkin
for like, five seconds. What's up?

00:14:10.951 --> 00:14:13.870
It's... It's something about the color.

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:16.707
Oh, boo-hoo.

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:19.710
Why are you crying now,
you depressed lunatic?

00:14:19.876 --> 00:14:22.546
I don't know. I should be happy.

00:14:22.629 --> 00:14:24.965
Bender's sausage just won third place.

00:14:25.048 --> 00:14:26.133
Third place?

00:14:26.216 --> 00:14:30.345
This is the greatest injustice
Germany has ever committed!

00:14:30.554 --> 00:14:33.265
Aha, Leela, we meet again.

00:14:33.348 --> 00:14:36.226
But this time,
I'm the one criticizing the sausage.

00:14:53.201 --> 00:14:56.163
Dear God, look at those hairy elephantes!

00:14:56.455 --> 00:14:58.457
Kill all modern humans!

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:00.083
Hey, this guy's all right.

00:15:09.635 --> 00:15:13.847
Battalion A, smash things!
Battalion B, smash different things!

00:15:40.582 --> 00:15:42.584
Oh, yeah. Second place!

00:15:45.587 --> 00:15:47.631
Release the giant sloth!

00:16:06.149 --> 00:16:08.193
- Do something!
- Fear not, Leela.

00:16:08.277 --> 00:16:13.407
They may not have technology, like us,
but we have something they don't have.

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:14.825
Technology.

00:16:17.077 --> 00:16:21.748
Behold our latest weapon,
a revolutionary fleet of unmanned drones.

00:16:21.832 --> 00:16:23.000
With men in them.

00:16:23.166 --> 00:16:24.710
Then how are they unmanned?

00:16:24.793 --> 00:16:26.253
The men are just for ballast.

00:16:26.336 --> 00:16:29.506
I control all the drones
from this single unit.

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:31.216
Foolproof and durable,

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:35.053
it's designed to withstand even the weight
of a modern-day elephant foot.

00:16:52.321 --> 00:16:54.781
Chef Fritz, thank God you're all right!

00:16:54.865 --> 00:16:56.325
Come with me, I'll protect you!

00:17:22.684 --> 00:17:25.103
Neanderthals, load catapult!

00:17:25.812 --> 00:17:29.524
Up here in the clouds,
our technology makes us invincible,

00:17:29.608 --> 00:17:31.860
like the mighty "X" in tic-tac-toe.

00:17:31.944 --> 00:17:34.446
Look at those pathetic cavemen down there,

00:17:34.529 --> 00:17:36.448
loading their silly catapult with...

00:17:37.032 --> 00:17:38.033
What is that, Kif?

00:17:41.787 --> 00:17:44.456
I believe it's a saber-tooth cat, sir.

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:57.469
I guess it's just me and you, chicken hat.

00:18:05.394 --> 00:18:07.562
Die, you primitive brute!

00:18:26.748 --> 00:18:28.375
What do you Neanderthals want?

00:18:28.458 --> 00:18:30.210
We want our land back!

00:18:30.294 --> 00:18:33.797
Also, to be treated as equals!
And a little mating wouldn't hurt!

00:18:46.727 --> 00:18:47.978
Orange?

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:49.688
Purple?

00:18:50.105 --> 00:18:51.898
- Do I know you?
- Have we met?

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:08.415
What Orange-Hair doing with Homo sapien?

00:19:08.624 --> 00:19:11.168
Uh, look like interbreeding.

00:19:11.335 --> 00:19:12.961
Ow! Ahhh!

00:19:13.128 --> 00:19:15.464
You want make love, not war?

00:19:15.547 --> 00:19:16.590
Jawohl.

00:19:18.342 --> 00:19:21.470
This change everything, Tight-Clothes-Man.

00:19:21.678 --> 00:19:26.391
We forgive Homo sapiens
for actions of stuck-up ancestors.

00:19:26.475 --> 00:19:27.517
So be it.

00:19:27.601 --> 00:19:30.187
In recognition of
your overwhelming victory,

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:31.980
let's call it a draw.

00:19:48.997 --> 00:19:50.040
Fry?

00:19:51.917 --> 00:19:52.960
Leela?

00:19:53.043 --> 00:19:55.504
I didn't recognize you
with your head all swollen.

00:19:55.587 --> 00:19:56.922
But it looks better now.

00:19:57.005 --> 00:19:59.508
I guess the blood must have rushed
somewhere else.

00:19:59.967 --> 00:20:03.971
Guys, guys! Chef Fritz accidentally
got thrown down an icy slope!

00:20:04.054 --> 00:20:06.640
I'm the sausage champion!

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:08.475
No further questions!

00:20:11.144 --> 00:20:13.355
Rounds for everybody!

00:20:33.292 --> 00:20:36.962
Now this is Oktoberfest!
Just like the olden days.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:40.007
I have to admit, your version is more fun.

00:20:41.466 --> 00:20:43.802
They're playing our stupid song!

00:20:45.012 --> 00:20:46.221
Care to join me?

00:20:46.471 --> 00:20:50.642
No, Leela. Just this once,
I'm going to let you embarrass me.